                     <text>
                        <list listType="unordered">
                           <item>pain gets worse or lasts for more then 5 days</item>
                           <item>fever gets worse or last for more then 3 days</item>
                           <item>new symptoms occur redness or swelling is present. These could be signs of a serious condition. 
  
